	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"setTrophy", name="TR008"},
		{"eval", exp="g.no107=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050010"},
		line=825,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Standing in wait outside the Imperial Temple, I cast mine gaze up at the endlessly clear sky.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The crisp, early-morning air stings mine eyes.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is currently performing the final purification rites within the ritual chamber.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"There will be no turning back once the ritual commences.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"If it is interrupted midway, both Himi-no-Mikoto and the child inside Chihaya will be in grave danger.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The success of this precarious ritual hangs on a blade's edge.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"And in its final stages, I am to claim Himi-no-Mikoto's life.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Doing so will dissever her soul from her mortal body and transfer it to the child inside Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"All mine life, I have felt nary a moment of doubt or hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Thus it was that I slew all those who stood athwart mine path.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I merely obeyed mine orders, and in doing so, fulfilled mine purpose.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"But all that changes today.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Today, I will claim another's life of mine own free will... and slay Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...Why do I hesitate?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Why do mine hands tremble so?",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"─Will I be able to claim her life in a single stroke?",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"─Will I even be able to swing mine blade down at all?",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I have claimed countless lives, but never before have I hesitated so.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"If this is what it means to possess a human heart, what terribly frail and anxious creatures humans must be...",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"...What beautiful creatures they must be, to be endowed with such frailty yet strive so relentlessly to live without hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I mustn't hesitate.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Slowly, I open and close mine fingers into a tight fist.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto believes in me. She saw fit to entrust her final moments to mine hands.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"As such, I must steel mine heart.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I must steel mine heart... and claim Himi-no-Mikoto's life.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"A wail of despair echoes out from deep within the temple.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"At the same time, the spellwards surrounding the temple shatter into pieces.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto!”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"I burst into the ritual chamber.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Why, if it isn't Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Whatever might it be that has you so panicked?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Chihaya greets me with her usual carefree smile.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"But─",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"In her hands, a gory dagger drips with blood.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Chihaya, what have you...”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Khh...! Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto lets out a groan at Chihaya's feet.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Her abdomen is stained a vivid red, and the pool of blood spreading out beneath her is growing by the second.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh my? You still persist in clinging to life? How delightful you are, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Raaaaaaaarrrggh!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Chihaya deftly leaps backwards, parrying mine quick-draw strike.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"No mere mortal ought to have blocked that.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"But because I forced her to retreat, I am able to rush to\nHimi-no-Mikoto's side.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto! Himi-no-Mikoto?!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“She caught me off guard... I... have no excuse...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh dear, oh dear! Whatever is the matter, Mitsurugi-sama? It is most unlike you to show such hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Could it be that you are concerned about the child in my belly?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“After all, this child belongs to none other than you and Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, does it not?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do not be fooled... That is not Chihaya...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Kill her...!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"If so, I have no need to hold back.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Chihaya, cast aside your blade!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Heh... heheheh...! Hahaha! Ahahahaha! Kyahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What are you laughing at?!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, how swell! How swell this is, Mitsurugi! I can't believe me plan went off without a hitch!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Chihaya's voice suddenly transforms into the gravelly drawl of a man's.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"It's a vaguely familiar voice... a rasp that grates mine nerves to their core.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The same voice that Tooru uttered in his dying throes.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What manner of man are you?!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Y'already knows who I am, Mitsurugi. Never hads meself a name in me life.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Name yourself!”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“D'you really gots the time for these stupid questions?\nHimi-no-Mikoto's havin' a real hard time o' things over there...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The strength has already drained from Himi-no-Mikoto's body.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"I haven't any time to waste in tending to her.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hows about it? How's it feel, losin' the one y'love most?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You brought this on yourself, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You promised you'd hitch me and Himi-no-Mikoto together, but y'sure got cozy with her once I was outta the picture!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, how you wound me fragile lil' heart.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Are you...?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"He speaks as though possessed of Tooru's memories.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“And so y'see, I decided to take Himi-no-Mikoto's life all for meself.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The man in the shape of Chihaya licks the blood dripping from his hand.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“*Sluuurp...!* Heheh... Sooo sweet... I've never tasted anything sweeter, Mitsurugi!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Seeing this, mine rage boils over.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Curse yoooouuuu!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I cleave him atwain even as he continues to lick at his hand.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hah...! Hah... heh... heh...”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Lament your folly for all eternity... in having Himi-no-Mikoto stolen away from you...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I crush his head underfoot to silence him, before rushing over to cradle Himi-no-Mikoto in mine arms.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsu... rugi...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Save your strength! We need to Heal you right away!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto limply shakes her head.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“There is no point... This body was already at its limit...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Then the reincarnation ritual!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Now that the chamber is sullied with blood... it is impossible...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The encroaching despair threatens to overwhelm me.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"─Am I powerless but to watch her leave me?",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"─Born for the battlefield, am I so powerless to save but a single life?",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This was all... my own folly...”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That which became Chihaya... is beyond any mortal ken...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“He is a grudge upon the Empire... A calamity upon mankind...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“He knew about the criminal─and about Tooru, too!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What manner of fiend is he?!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I fear he is... a curse I unleashed unto this world...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's voice drops below even that of a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Stay with me!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My soul... meant for the infant... will drift to places unknown...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But some day... I promise... I shall return...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Until that day comes... please... protect the Empire...”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I will. I swear it.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Thank you...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto reaches out towards mine cheek with a contented smile.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I had a premonition... that I would meet my end like this...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hehee... If only... I could have met my end at your hands...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, Himi-no-Mikoto...!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I was right by her side, yet I let this happen...",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"I bite mine lip until it draws blood, but time inexorably continues its forward march.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis no matter... The thought that you were willing... is more than enough... for me...”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How human... you've managed to become... Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"One after another, they flutter down.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"These teardrops of Persica, precious beyond all measure.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"The priestesses around us marvel at the miracle they are witnessing.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Standing before the ghastly edifice she believed herself to have wrought, a lorn and lonely girl sealed away her own tears.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Thus even now, even as she departs from this world, none will know of her sorrow.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'll wait for you, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Thank you, Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Fare thee well... 'til we meet again...”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Amidst that driving tempest of Persica─",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Her lips and mine come together.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“(I love you, Mitsurugi...)”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"This whisper escapes her lips as the last of the strength slips from her body.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The weight in mine arms suddenly disappears─",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Replaced in an instant by a burst of scattering peach petals.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"They flutter through the chamber in one last farewell before slowly dissolving on the wind.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Where she once lay, nothing else remains─",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Save for a magatama, shimmering in a Persica hue.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto... is no more?",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Mine creator, mine one and only lord─",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"The absolute sovereign of this Empire, the innocent girl upon that hillside, the sun in mine sky...",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Vanished from this world.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Slain by a nameless lunatic.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"I was meant to send her off with mine own two hands─",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Yet I failed to grant even that final deliverance to her.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The savior of the realm...?",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"He who cuts down all calamity befalling the Empire...?",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"In the end, I was of no use at all.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"I'm sorry.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I'm sorry...",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"All the strength leaves mine body with that whisper.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Clutching the magatama in mine hand, I gaze up at the ceiling in despair.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Here again, am I─",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Upon this familiar hillside.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Many a time, I accompanied Himi-no-Mikoto to this place.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"But now, I am alone.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto and Chihaya are no more.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"The same day that the reincarnation ritual was foiled,\nChihaya's body was discovered in a secluded corner of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"The culprit must have killed her and stolen her form with magicks in order to murder Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Even now, the madness in his voice still haunts mine memories.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"In the moments before their end, both Tooru and the criminal he executed spoke in the same way.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"What manner of fiend could he be?",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That which became Chihaya... is beyond any mortal ken...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“He is a grudge upon the Empire... A calamity upon mankind...”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I fear he is... a curse I unleashed unto this world...”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"There is a queer existence haunting this Empire.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"An existence malefic and sinister, one responsible for stealing away the three people most precious to me.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Tooru. Chihaya. Himi-no-Mikoto─",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"No matter who or what it was that claimed your lives...",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I will avenge you. I swear it.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"With Himi-no-Mikoto and Chihaya slain, the reincarnation ritual was doomed.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Yet even as it seemed the sun was about to set on the Empire, not all hope was lost.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Though Chihaya breathed her last, the child inside her was miraculously unharmed.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"I know not how long I stood vigil over Himi-no-Mikoto's body, but it was the sound of that infant's cries which returned me to the waking world.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Guided by that voice, I came upon Chihaya's body, defending her baby even in her final moments.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"It was surely her boundless love as a mother which delivered that child from harm.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"That child of the three of us─me, Himi-no-Mikoto, and Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"In order to preserve the Empire's future, the second Exalt-Priestess and I met in secret.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"There, we contrived a fiction of Himi-no-Mikoto's death and rebirth.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"This was the story we announced to the people:",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"─Sensing her end drawing close, Himi-no-Mikoto cloistered herself away in the ritual chamber, declaring that she will be reborn in seven days.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"─Indeed, after seven days and nights had passed, a faint cry could be heard from within the chamber.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"─When the Exalt-Priestess threw open the door, there she found a newborn babe wreathed in splendorous raiments.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"The people accepted this account with startling ease.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Because they truly believed Himi-no-Mikoto to be the child of Oomikami─",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"They disavowed any possibility that their supreme sovereign could ever perish from this world, instead choosing to accept her reincarnation as fact.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"So it came to pass that this child born of miracle now sits upon the Empire's throne as its second Empress.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Though the heads of the noble houses administer the realm on the young Empress's behalf, the Imperial bloodline was still preserved.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"One final question now loomed over the Empire's future.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The fate of the three treasures Himi-no-Mikoto bequeathed upon the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"The looking-glass offered in tribute by Ko no Kuni, the magatama Himi-no-Mikoto left behind, and myself.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"As we learned from the chancellor's rebellion, Ko no Kuni's looking-glass corrupts the minds of those harboring secret ambitions in their heart.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"It needs to be securely sealed away, that none may ever lay their hands upon it.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's magatama, needless to say, must be safeguarded until she returns.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"And by all rights, I ought to remain stationed within the Imperial Palace, that I might defend the Empress from all those who might contemplate rebellion.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"But in truth, I yearn to scour the realm in search of\nHimi-no-Mikoto's killer.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"With all this in mind, the Exalt-Priestess and I devised a plan.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"First, Ko no Kuni's looking-glass and Himi-no-Mikoto's magatama are to be securely sealed away in secret locations.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"Then, in order to erase their memory from the collective consciousness, fictional artifacts known as the Three Sacred Treasures are to be added to the Imperial Chronicle.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"The Three Sacred Treasures will be mythologized as divine artifacts bestowed upon Himi-no-Mikoto by Oomikami Himself.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Following that, a replica looking-glass, magatama, and blade are to be enshrined within the Imperial Palace for all to see.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Of course, these would be no more than mere ornaments, but in due time, they will surely come to be revered as instruments of divinity.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"If all this can be done, within a few generations, none will remember the existence of the true Sacred Treasures.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"And I will be free to set forth on mine journey.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“How peaceful it is.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"The only sound that reaches mine ears is the raucous voice of songbirds celebrating the advent of a new spring.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Beyond the crest of the hill, plumes of smoke from countless hearthfires lazily curl up towards the sky.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"You once taught me that the smoke of hearthfires is the surest proof that the people are living in prosperity.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto─",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Mine creator, mine one and only lord.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"You were mine everything.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"And this vista from our hillside... was surely your finest creation.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, heed my command.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You are to do all that is in your power to understand human emotions.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Since I received Himi-no-Mikoto's edict, I've noticed myself slowly beginning to change.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Though bereft of a human heart, I still strove to understand its inner workings, and in the process, discovered the greatest joy I had ever known.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"And with it, the desolation and sorrow of its passing.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"How hollow and faded the world becomes, as soon as you lose the one you hold most dear...",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"But I cannot allow myself to remain despondent.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My soul... meant for the infant... will drift to places unknown...”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But some day... I promise... I shall return...”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Until that day comes... please... protect the Empire...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“On mine life, your will shall be done.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Watch over me, mine love─",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"I shall not rest until I have cut down that direful spring of calamity, that nemesis who robbed me of all I hold dear. Thus shall I protect this Empire─",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"For ages more... patiently awaiting your return.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
